X_{e0}-L_{2}^{0}\left(  X_{e1}\right)  +L_{2}^{0}\left(  X_{e2}\right) \\
X_{e1}-2L_{2}^{1}\left(  X_{e2}\right) \\
X_{e2}\\
0
\end{array}
\right)  $ \emph{may or may not} be positive.
